fields "answer-field-9da6b88c-3427-5d82-9c0a-0c12e0c3ee52"] [17592186221420 :knowledge-point/questions "question-047ba9d9-f028-5122-88f6-0f2794537abb"] ["question-2812ec6f-62e9-58a6-b999-e2e9bb1ef20a" :question/id #uuid "2812ec6f-62e9-58a6-b999-e2e9bb1ef20a"] ["question-2812ec6f-62e9-58a6-b999-e2e9bb1ef20a" :question/math-academy-id "q-334287"] ["question-2812ec6f-62e9-58a6-b999-e2e9bb1ef20a" :question/problem "$$\n{x}^{′}=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{aligned}]x,\\,{x}_{1}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{t},\\,{x}_{2}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]{e}^{5t}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear ODEs and two of its linearly independent solutions ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2},$ shown above. Which of the following is a fundamental matrix for the system?"] ["question-2812ec6f-62e9-58a6-b999-e2e9bb1ef20a" :question/worked-solution "Given a linear system ${x}^{′}=Ax,$ where $A$ is an $n\\times n$ matrix, a *fundamental matrix* $Φ(t)$ of the system is an $n\\times n$ matrix whose columns are linearly independent solutions of the system.\n\nIn our case, we have a $2\\times 2$ system. We are also given that the two linearly independent solutions of the system are the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{t}=[\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{t} \\\\ -{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]{e}^{5t}=[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{5t} \\\\ 3{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, our fundamental could be written as\n\n$$\nΦ(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{t} & {e}^{5t} \\\\ -{e}^{t} & 3{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n**Note:** The columns of $Φ$ can be written in any order."] ["question-2812ec6f-62e9-58a6-b999-e2e9bb1ef20a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8" :answer-field/id #uuid "7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8"] ["answer-be97f123-ee31-529e-ad62-b60cd32f0447" :answer/id #uuid "be97f123-ee31-529e-ad62-b60cd32f0447"] ["answer-be97f123-ee31-529e-ad62-b60cd32f0447" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-be97f123-ee31-529e-ad62-b60cd32f0447" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-a0f3c51e-4158-53a9-8000-4d759b58f125" :answer/id #uuid "a0f3c51e-4158-53a9-8000-4d759b58f125"] ["answer-a0f3c51e-4158-53a9-8000-4d759b58f125" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a0f3c51e-4158-53a9-8000-4d759b58f125" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2e & {e}^{5} \\\\ -e & 3{e}^{5}\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-5b9538e4-7f8a-5b8c-82bb-35b03e432d62" :answer/id #uuid "5b9538e4-7f8a-5b8c-82bb-35b03e432d62"] ["answer-5b9538e4-7f8a-5b8c-82bb-35b03e432d62" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5b9538e4-7f8a-5b8c-82bb-35b03e432d62" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{t} & 3{e}^{5t} \\\\ -{e}^{t} & {e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-c012ce1d-eb1d-5b42-88cb-96ac6a6d3311" :answer/id #uuid "c012ce1d-eb1d-5b42-88cb-96ac6a6d3311"] ["answer-c012ce1d-eb1d-5b42-88cb-96ac6a6d3311" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c012ce1d-eb1d-5b42-88cb-96ac6a6d3311" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{t} & {e}^{5t} \\\\ -{e}^{t} & 3{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-a33d5d0e-3557-5992-9c38-968bde775fc4" :answer/id #uuid "a33d5d0e-3557-5992-9c38-968bde775fc4"] ["answer-a33d5d0e-3557-5992-9c38-968bde775fc4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a33d5d0e-3557-5992-9c38-968bde775fc4" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8" :answer-field/correct "answer-c012ce1d-eb1d-5b42-88cb-96ac6a6d3311"] ["answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8" :answer-field/choices "answer-be97f123-ee31-529e-ad62-b60cd32f0447"] ["answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8" :answer-field/choices "answer-a0f3c51e-4158-53a9-8000-4d759b58f125"] ["answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8" :answer-field/choices "answer-5b9538e4-7f8a-5b8c-82bb-35b03e432d62"] ["answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8" :answer-field/choices "answer-c012ce1d-eb1d-5b42-88cb-96ac6a6d3311"] ["answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8" :answer-field/choices "answer-a33d5d0e-3557-5992-9c38-968bde775fc4"] ["question-2812ec6f-62e9-58a6-b999-e2e9bb1ef20a" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-7e1c8270-c94c-5afb-bb4e-783c3deb13c8"] [17592186221420 :knowledge-point/questions "question-2812ec6f-62e9-58a6-b999-e2e9bb1ef20a"] ["question-808ef5db-aeee-5e2b-ba0b-cf24a0046d0e" :question/id #uuid "808ef5db-aeee-5e2b-ba0b-cf24a0046d0e"] ["question-808ef5db-aeee-5e2b-ba0b-cf24a0046d0e" :question/math-academy-id "q-334308"] ["question-808ef5db-aeee-5e2b-ba0b-cf24a0046d0e" :question/problem "$$\n{x}^{′}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]x,\\,{x}_{1}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-t},\\,{x}_{2}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}t+2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-t}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear ODEs and two of its linearly independent solutions ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2},$ shown above. Which of the following is a fundamental matrix for the system?"] ["question-808ef5db-aeee-5e2b-ba0b-cf24a0046d0e" :question/worked-solution "Given a linear system ${x}^{′}=Ax,$ where $A$ is an $n\\times n$ matrix, a *fundamental matrix* $Φ(t)$ of the system is an $n\\times n$ matrix whose columns are linearly independent solutions of the system.\n\nIn our case, we have a $2\\times 2$ system. We are also given that the two linearly independent solutions of the system are the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-t}=[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-t} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}t+2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-t}=[\\begin{aligned}(t+2){e}^{-t} \\\\ {e}^{-t}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, our fundamental could be written as\n\n$$\nΦ(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-t} & (t+2){e}^{-t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{-t}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n**Note:** The columns of $Φ$ can be written in any order."] ["question-808ef5db-aeee-5e2b-ba0b-cf24a0046d0e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-a8483fff-76a3-580a-a83e-5302b7c416d0" :answer-field/id #uuid "a8483fff-76a3-580a-a83e-5302b7c416d0"] ["answer-72ffadc4-335c-55d0-bd36-1d3163db7d26" :answer/id #uuid "72ffadc4-335c-55d0-bd36-1d3163db7d26"] ["answer-72ffadc4-335c-55d0-bd36-1d3163db7d26" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-72ffadc4-335c-55d0-bd36-1d3163db7d26" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}(t+2){e}^{-t} & {e}^{-t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{-t}\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-81e20a17-4b6b-5eb7-b397-570b9f0dd097" :answer/id #uuid "81e20a17-4b6b-5eb7-b397-570b9f0dd097"] ["answer-81e20a17-4b6b-5eb7-b397-570b9f0dd097" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-81e20a17-4b6b-5eb7-b397-570b9f0dd097" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-156d4f34-709c-5fbe-897d-5e8c2b73d56a" :answer/id #uuid "156d4f34-709c-5fbe-897d-5e8c2b73d56a"] ["answer-156d4f34-709c-5fbe-897d-5e8c2b73d56a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-156d4f34-709c-5fbe-897d-5e8c2b73d56a" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & t+2 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-3947fe3e-dc6f-51d9-bcfa-9d26dd70ad67" :answer/id #uuid "3947fe3e-dc6f-51d9-bcfa-9d26dd70ad67"] ["answer-3947fe3e-dc6f-51d9-bcfa-9d26dd70ad67" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3947fe3e-dc6f-51d9-bcfa-9d26dd70ad67" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-1} & 3{e}^{-1} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{-1}\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-e16debc0-ce3c-5f96-873e-38c12a03e8c4" :answer/id #uuid "e16debc0-ce3c-5f96-873e-38c12a03e8c4"] ["answer-e16debc0-ce3c-5f96-873e-38c12a03e8c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e16debc0-ce3c-5f96-873e-38c12a03e8c4" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-t} & (t+2){e}^{-t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{-t}\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-field-a8483fff-76a3-580a-a83e-5302b7c416d